[b][h1]Update 1.0.5.2 [/h1][/b]

[b]On 21st of January there is going to be a short maintenance session to update game to 1.0.5.2 version, which will last 1-2 hours. Time is a subject to change. Update will be performed starting from 11 AM Moscow time (GMT+3).[/b]

[list][*]Detailed statistics for day, month, all time; accessible in player profile;
[*]Global player search (various parameters included); accessible in player profile;
[*]Small adjustments to vehicle models;
[*]Major English localization fixes;
[*]Removed music absence glitch in Steam and GameNet versions of game;
[*]Removed seasonal decorations;
[*]Small adjustments to graphic interface;
[*]Vehicle upgrade cooldown time returned back;
[*]Discounts and actions from 25th to 31st of January, keep an eye on updates![/list]

[list][*]50% discount on:
[list][*] - "Double Nitro" supply
[*] - "Powerful antiradar"
[*]- Premium vehicle "Leviathan"[/list]

[*]Available for purchase: unique paint 'Salamander'
[*]Buy 5000 gold (without bonus count) and receive 10 days Premium subscription for free![/list]

